{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_598591c31020e723ccfe711ca433001074cfef4c3f9841053120198bc15a26e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b3f357ed82b0444d3d42b987eb68da02b830c7346e4c745bed6dd919f7ea383d"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b"],"text":"Providers span subscription sign-in (ChatGPT Plus/Pro, Claude Pro/Max, GitHub Copilot), API-key providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, Groq, DeepSeek, and others), OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and local providers such as Ollama.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5c22cc44217616e2d5d904e69206b0f7eb528f2deef6a42c5fe78b70315bbb12","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_254a1ec478924a0f1727c3719287a6b582a1fed44ddf883a3ad10dde606f21d8","slc_52a5525f88e9bf9c63b3fed279316eddb29ebeb7bea37a88329237a9ee78eff6","slc_a043269620e9c707eb44a60d111a0a894f0309d9491cc2c639ed51beea8e6a16","slc_adbd7470b16e876623214bf9368c1a5f58f3a82469f7c21b25550d9d24d94ee5","slc_f35caeca9fcda53aca630402603cf36ec9a02b2be23e8ec126e32d5cacff6cfa"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b","src_7e76bd9a478b5249be9ef3af3bcfd83a"],"text":"The product uses approval prompts, permissions, and profiles to keep actions under human control; `--sandbox-mode` overrides sandbox policy per run with read-only, workspace-write, or danger-full-access values.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_65681661242f27f44d30df6e5eccdbe69e23ebda9676a62bce250c5c465bdca5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_545ffb912688393b2c2a1ebcc1d6408a18b73220442464189693f044ea9c0512"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b"],"text":"The npm `stemcode` package is a thin installer that downloads the matching release binary and verifies it against published SHA256SUMS, with no .NET toolchain required; targets include win-x64, osx-x64, osx-arm64, linux-x64, and linux-arm64.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_728277689f0f0bdd63bc54d7630decaee69658e9775f2ae2ecda039be7b47c8a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1439f07715f0d83efebd2a97ba1f51ed2cc3d64264f8587482479522916f7059","slc_3ed9d83279ba21d2d86717bf55b64186d8e7666de7badb010c0e8c3f640a2190"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b","src_7e76bd9a478b5249be9ef3af3bcfd83a"],"text":"Release assets publish SHA256SUMS and GitHub artifact attestations; the release pipeline verifies each checksum before publishing, and `gh attestation verify` is documented for provenance checks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c1032f0da4048c2d00d8e56ec33f93fb4488855e37ab4e527038043f5362a6d8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_adbd7470b16e876623214bf9368c1a5f58f3a82469f7c21b25550d9d24d94ee5"],"source_ids":["src_7e76bd9a478b5249be9ef3af3bcfd83a"],"text":"Subagents run delegated tasks with independent contexts to keep the main conversation focused, and interactive user questions support clarification, multiple-choice, multi-select, and free-form input.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d975a0b6cdce10dfefc6859497e00509664da66c578689ee0e97c5b38c0e4316","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52a5525f88e9bf9c63b3fed279316eddb29ebeb7bea37a88329237a9ee78eff6"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b"],"text":"The CLI supports options including `--acp`, `--stdin`, `--json`, `-p/--prompt`, `--sandbox-mode`, `--session`, `--profile`, `--thinking`, and `--doctor`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e4010c7b6011cc99f0b548fc133c4a9b34ece1f04cb5b2df5986df952c6230fa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"rizwan3d/stemcode@dfe4dd789988 snapshot 7835cc5cd29fd935","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3f36f6e57f7ba6e036822a78f41fcb1c90a26312bd35bdfe060c03bc9367df90","slc_5e8b88610a7cfb73d22bc46f26f5ce6e0daacfdb0e5a5cb6aae9b6523275ad1e","slc_e47319d0f8cd29fff5a66ffbcc41f6a97bb952520a02795e986252aff0b5beba","slc_fc1f4876fa5dccbf42c014907adcc73ede0ace4ca679cd149a548b984f6018fb"],"source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b"],"text":"Built-in tracked edit tools include `file_write`, `apply_patch`, `insert_content`, and `search_and_replace`, which record before/after state and participate in `/undo`, `/redo`, and edit summaries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
